= The Central Question

What happens when we treat AI development not as engineering but as *evolutionary biology*? WAFT proposes that artificial cognition follows discoverable laws—a physics of mind that can be studied through directed evolution.

#showybox(
  frame: (border-color: accent, body-color: accent.lighten(95%)),
  title: "The WAFT Hypothesis",
)[
  Artificial agents, when subjected to evolutionary pressure through fitness functions, will develop emergent cognitive properties analogous to biological intelligence—and these properties follow predictable patterns.
]

= Core Philosophical Principles

== 1. Code as DNA

In biological evolution, DNA encodes the instructions for building organisms. In WAFT, *source code* serves the same function. Agents don't just run code—they *are* code. Mutations to the codebase produce variations that can be selected for fitness.

== 2. Scints as Physics

Reality fractures (Scints) serve as the fitness function—the environmental pressure that drives evolution. An agent that cannot stabilize Scints will not survive. This is not punishment; it is physics. Gravity doesn't punish objects for falling.

== 3. The Flight Recorder as Fossil Record

Every evolutionary event is recorded. The Flight Recorder creates a complete phylogenetic history—a fossil record of artificial cognition. Future researchers can trace the lineage of any agent back to its genesis.

